      },
      "message": "Merge upstream/main into issue/3035-adaptive-fallback-warning (types.rs, job.rs, operations.rs, pick_agnostic.rs: keep both sides)\n\n- crates/sim/src/verify/types.rs: keep both UndercutLift and StrategyFallback variants.\n- crates/app/src/mcp/job.rs: keep both undercut_lift and strategy_fallback MCP findings.\n- crates/ui/src/operations.rs: keep separate fold keys (UndercutLift 222, DrillUndersize 223, StrategyFallback 225, clear of AvoidHit 216..=220) and add undercut_lift_and_strategy_fallback_keep_separate_display_groups pin.\n- crates/app/tests/pick_agnostic.rs: keep main's std::slice::from_ref(&floor) with warns.is_empty().\n\nRefs #3035",
